  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Pacific Fisheries - Country Capacity and Capability</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the next phase of New&#xa0;Zealand&#x2019;s regionally-delivered development assistance (2024-2028) into building country-level capacity and capability to address persistent regional challenges to sustainable fisheries management, including Illegal, Unreported and Unregulated fishing (particularly for offshore fisheries).</narrative>
  </description>
